    {
      "id": "a100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🧠 OddsWell multi-brain architecture\n\nAI chooses intentions. Authoritative engines validate and resolve consequences. Every important decision becomes memory and evidence for controlled learning.",
      "x": -300,
      "y": -950,
      "width": 760,
