    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000006",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -1050,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 780,
      "color": "2",
      "label": "Shared Across Every Sport"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🧍 Athlete Life Brain\n\nPersonalities · goals · relationships · discipline · stress · morale · money · sleep · training · recovery · social life\n\nChooses off-court actions and carries their consequences into careers.",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": -480,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🌍 World + League Brain\n\nSchedules, teams, contracts, careers, news, social context, shared history, and persistent world state.",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000009",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -250,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 780,
      "color": "4",
      "label": "Sport-Specific Intelligence"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🏀 Basketball AI Brain\n\n🤖 **GUARDED LLM POLICY**\n\nReceives a sports-only snapshot and must choose one enumerated legal action. Invalid or unavailable output falls back deterministically. Six request-bound LLM scenarios now pass; live provider approval is pending.",
      "x": -200,
      "y": -480,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10000000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ⚽ 🏈 ⚾ Future sport brains\n\nEach sport receives its own AI decision brain and rules engine while reusing the shared life, world, memory, and learning layers.",
      "x": -200,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10000000000000c",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 650,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 780,
      "color": "3",
      "label": "Authority and Audit"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10000000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ⚙️ Rules + Outcome Engine\n\n⭐ **SERVER AUTHORITY**\n\nValidates legal actions, applies ratings and state, uses seeded randomness, resolves consequences, and emits versioned events.",
      "x": 700,
      "y": -480,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10000000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🛡️ Competitive firewall\n\nCredits, purchases, and wagers cannot influence AI choices, rules, seeds, or outcomes. Invalid AI output is rejected rather than trusted.",
      "x": 700,
      "y": -130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10000000000000f",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 780,
      "color": "6",
      "label": "Memory and Controlled Learning"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 📚 Structured league data\n\nContext, choices, consequences, statistics, failures, costs, latency, and evaluation results become long-term evidence.",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": -480,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🔄 Learning loop\n\n1. Retrieve memory immediately\n2. Evaluate behavior and realism\n3. Test candidate prompt, policy, fine-tune, or model\n4. Promote a named version only after it passes\n\n💵 First retraining ceiling: $5 total\n🔒 Provider/model pending\n\nNo silent live self-rewriting.",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": -180,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🎞️ Permanent replay record\n\nModel/version + policy + structured AI decision tape + simulation seed + authoritative event log\n\nReplays never ask the LLM to reinvent the match.",
      "x": -450,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
